{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49878","headline":"临江仙 · 徐昌图","name":"临江仙","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"饮散离亭西去，浮生常恨飘蓬。\n回头烟柳渐重重，淡云孤鴈远，寒日暮天红。\n今夜画船何处，潮平淮月朦胧。\n酒醒人静奈愁浓，残灯孤枕梦，轻浪五更风。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐昌图","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49878.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49878","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}